text It's now the class after lunch.
label 4
text Since it's right after lunch, I'm overtaken by sleepiness.
text I space out. My teacher's voice almost sounds like a lullaby.
text It feels like my eyelids are almost closed..
text *Thud*
text @[Tomoya]
text Hm?
text Something hit my head.
text When I look down at the floor I see a small piece of an eraser.
sound 8UJ.aac
text @[Sunohara]
text Okazaki, Okazaki.
