text @[Tomoya]
text Hm...?
text I think I just caught a glimpse of something.
text It looks like a tiny animal moving around in small steps.
text It's rubbing its body against the gate wall, and happily wiggling its tiny tail...
text @[Tomoya]
text Botan...?
text It's Kyou's pet.
text If I remember correctly, it's a small baby boar.
text Is it here to see Kyou again?
